flowchart TD
    G[Read personal configuration]
    L[Choose at most one admissible local file]
    S{Local select present?}
    LS[Use local list, including an empty list]
    GS[Use personal list, or empty list]
    B[Apply personal base]
    P[Expand selected profiles in order]
    IN[For each occurrence: includes, then own values]
    A[Remember personally routed keys]
    O[Apply direct local values]
    V[Validate final configuration]
    G --> S
    L --> S
    S -->|yes| LS
    S -->|no| GS
    LS --> B
    GS --> B
    B --> P --> IN --> A --> O --> V
    A -. local routes cannot add keys .-> O
